[00:01.28] (Hank Williams)
[00:08.46] Today I passed you on the street
[00:12.58] And my heart fell at your feet
[00:16.30] I can't help it if I'm still in love with you
[00:23.46] Somebody else stood by your side
[00:28.34] And he looked so satisfied
[00:32.28] I can't help it if I'm still in love with you.
[00:41.20] A picture from the past came slowly stealing
[00:48.44] As I brushed your arm and walked so close to you
[00:56.82] Then suddenly I got that old time feeling
[01:04.36] I can't help it if I'm still in love with you.
[01:29.44] --- Instrumental ---
[01:29.44] It's hard to know another's lips will kiss you
[01:36.30] And hold you just the way I used to do
[01:45.26] Oh, heaven only knows how much I miss you
[01:52.76] I can't help it if I'm still in love with you...
